# Flash (CR 702.8a) and "enters with a -1/-1 counter" (CR 614.1c): Bot1 casts the Guardian in Bot2's second main phase, where a
# sorcery-speed creature could not be cast, and it arrives as a 2/3 flyer carrying one -1/-1 counter. (On Bot1's own turn
# it would be the same; the counter is part of entering, not a trigger.)

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Black Lotus
Glen Elendra Guardian
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main2]
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Hand.Glen Elendra Guardian.Cast
[T2 Bot2.End]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Glen Elendra Guardian.Counters.MinusOneMinusOne = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Glen Elendra Guardian.Power = 2
Bot1.Battlefield.Glen Elendra Guardian.Toughness = 3
Bot1.Battlefield.Glen Elendra Guardian.Keywords = Flash; Flying
